[node name="Label186" type="Label" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
text = "CHANGES
- Added direction indicators for Multiplayer to show in which directions your fellow Keepers are. The indicator can be disabled in the Options. 
- Added an option in the Infiltrator Input Settings to toggle between auto and manual pick-up of Kunai Carriers. The Infiltrator now can manually pick up Kunai Carriers using the interaction input. For that reason, Kunai Carriers get a highlight like other Carryables when in interaction range.
- Disabled the automatic pick-up of flying Kunai Carriers. They can be caught with manual pick-up. This should prevent unintentional pick-ups, especially in Multiplayer.
- Added an option for the Assessor, Infiltrator and Beastmaster to toggle whether resources or gadgets should be dropped first. The Engineer will still always drop the carried objects based on their distance.
- Added an option to scale the overall Loadout and most text in a run when playing in splitscreen. It's disabled by default and can be enabled if the text is too small in splitscreen, e.g. when playing with Steam Deck on a TV.
- Keeper Icons are now colored during the Keeper Selection screen when loading a save game or joining an active run. 

BUGFIXES
- Fixed tree seed sometimes glitching through the ground for clients.
- Fixed issue that prevented Prestige mode from continuing with 3 or more players. 
- Fixed infiltrator resource pickup after using the Sidedrill.
- Fixed Kunai Carrier behavior during pause.
- Fixed goblin holes not closing in some cases.
- Fixed unlocks of Skins sometimes unlocking for the wrong Keeper in Multiplayer.
- Fixed Orchard status not properly loading for clients when rejoining a run.
- Fixed Gadgets becoming uninteractable for clients after entering the Dome Station.
- Fixed Interactable Highlight showing for all players, when they should only show for the Beastmaster player.
- Fixed title music sometimes playing in a run.
- Fixed regular Keeper music playing even after the Relic has been found.
- Fixed the mouse back button sometimes not working in the Upgrade window.
- Fixed camera not scrolling to the dome when losing in Versus mode. 
- Fixed 'Thorough' achievement to be completable in the loadout. 
- Fixed pet greeting sound to play during the landing sequence."
autowrap_mode = 3

[node name="HSeparator41" type="HSeparator" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2

[node name="Label183" type="Label" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
texture_filter = 4
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("10")
text = "v5.0.7 Patch for The Lost Keepers"
label_settings = ExtResource("7")
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

[node name="Label184" type="Label" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
text = "CHANGES
- Prestige can now be played with more than 2 players in a casual way. Scores of Prestige Runs with 3 or more players are not uploaded. 
- Reworked Kunai Carriers to not collide with each other anymore for better usability and performance. Also the Kunai Carrier now stays intact when the connected tile is destroyed, so that you don't have to pick up all the resources again. 
- The Infiltrator can now pick up carryables while at max carry capacity, replacing the last carryable in the Kunai Carrier.
- New Versus modifier 'No Relics': No relics will spawn, removing relic stealing for a less competitive Versus experience.
- New Relic Hunt modifier 'Short Cycles': Cycles will be way shorter overall, presenting a new challenge. 
- New Relic Hunt modifier 'Tough Start': The initial wave strength is increased, presenting a new challenge.
- Added an option to toggle the Infiltrator's auto pickup behaviour for drops. The setting is found in the Keeper Input Options.

BUGFIXES
- Fixed kunai carrier not dissolving when entering the gravitational lift.
- Fixed client being incorrectly marked as a cheater in Prestige Miner mode. This also caused the score not to upload for the client.
- Fixed sessions claiming to be full if a player disconnects during landing stage. 
- Fixed goblin holes being dug out while the game is paused.
- Fixed parasitic drone nest being invisible when rejoining a game.
- Fixed visual glitches with World7 background in Versus mode.
- Fixed droneyard station clipping through artillery dome.
- Fixed infiltrator chain stretching when gadget/supplement popup opens.
- Fixed catgoblins and vines to be on top of the shaft gadgets to match the goblin holes.
- Fixed resources getting stuck in the loadout when tiles were mined while the game mode changed. 
- Fixed a crash for the host that sometimes appeared when tiles were mined while the game mode changed.
- Fixed resources carried by gravitational lift not counting towards the achievement 'My good Mule'.
- Fixed relic animation not triggering for the clients.
- Fixed gadget selection not being remembered between multiple assignment runs.
- Fixed loaded runs playing the wrong keeper's music.
- Fixed drops falling off the map when a Beastmaster tried to take drops from another Beastmaster.
- Fixed Kunai Carrier getting stuck at edges sometimes. "
autowrap_mode = 3

[node name="HSeparator40" type="HSeparator" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2

[node name="Label181" type="Label" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
texture_filter = 4
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("10")
text = "v5.0.6 Patch for The Lost Keepers"
label_settings = ExtResource("7")
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

[node name="Label182" type="Label" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
text = "MAJOR
- Improved the physics synchronization between client and host, which improves the network stability greatly. 
- Added a ping label in the pause menu for clients to check the current ping from client to server. 
- Reworked the Beastmaster carry and throw to be as before v5.0.5.
- When twin-stick is enabled, the Assessor and Infiltrator will still use the current move direction for their abilities if no aim direction is given.

MINOR
- Myzel now spawns Mushrooms faster the more players are in the team to make it viable in multiplayer.
- Catgoblins now climb down the vine not being upside down. 
- Prevent binding Escape / Start Button to any action.
- Packed drops now deal the proper damage when shredded in the 'Hurtful Iron' assignment. 
- When a client drops during the landing stage, the others will still be able to continue the game and the disconnected client can re-join. 
- Tracking damage from the Spire in the detailed statistics now.
- Adjusted the Kunai Carrier delivery distance for shredding.
- Some performance improvements on the Infiltrators Kunai Carrier. 

BUGFIXES
- Fixed a bug where Input was broken in a loaded multiplayer savegame after switching keepers.
- Fixed a crash that happened when leaving to title stage while a Kunai Carrier was flying.
- Fixed some battle abilities not loading properly when a client joins an active run.
- Fixed tiles spawning multiple drops due to high latency.
- Fixed projectiles being stuck on sword dome's surface after being reflected with the sword shield.
- Fixed artillery gun shooting for other clients when exiting while keeping the shoot button pressed.
- Fixed multiplayer boards not loading for previous seasons.
- Fixed one-way teleporter being off when loading a savegame with an active portal.
- Fixed clients breaking the game when they join right when the host starts the game.
- Fixed the leaderboard for multiplayer prestige not loading properly sometimes.
- Fixed drops getting stuck with the gravitational lift in some cases.
- Fixed goblin entrance hole appearing even if there is no Beastmaster currently selected.
- Fixed partially opened goblin holes closing animation.
- Fixed the Keeper changing the color at some places in the loadout. 
- Fixed dome ambience not playing.
- Fixed starting camera being off. 
- Fixed various bugs that were caused by throwing gadgets and relics into the opposing team's dome. 
- Fixed Infiltrator run animations when playing with controller.
- Fixed the upgrade tree showing wrong values when there are multiple predecessor branches.
- Removed the mini dome in the background of the landing scene.
- Fixed visual sorting for some dome elements.
- Fixed sound of Stunlaser.
- Fixed Infiltrator aim indicator showing while at dome station.
- Fixed some game ending tracks not looping properly.
- Fixed the laser dome weapon starting with the wrong animation.
- Fixed secondary station not showing when restarting in split-screen mode. 
- Fixed clients not being able to buy any upgrades after a lag spike. 
- Fixed some pixel bleeding with one of the Engineer skins.
- Fixed the music cycle option not working properly. Music now plays at the set amount of cycles.
- Fixed Chainsaw particles and audio to play during a soft pause (e.g. when in station).
- Fixed packed drops from the Resource Packer becoming invisible for clients.
- Fixed clients keeper not getting removed when a gamepad controller disconnects.
- Fixed keeper gadgets not being spawned for players that rejoin a run. 
- Fixed upgrades not being saved when a player rejoined a restarted run. 
- Fixed Suitblaster Tutorial showing for the whole team, not just the owning player. 
- Fixed a crash due to interaction between the Kunai Carrier and the Ressource Packer. 
- Fixed Suitblaster and Resource Packer charges resetting when a player rejoins a run. "
autowrap_mode = 3

[node name="HSeparator39" type="HSeparator" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2

[node name="Label179" type="Label" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
texture_filter = 4
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("10")
text = "v5.0.5 Patch for The Lost Keepers"
label_settings = ExtResource("7")
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

[node name="Label180" type="Label" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
text = "MAJOR
- Improved performance of catgoblins, especially for larger maps
- Second Station now is available in multiplayer games right from the start, but with its weapon disabled. The weapon can be enabled via the same upgrade as before. This change allows multiple keepers to buy upgrades at the same time. 
- New modifier for Versus, which enables the second station's weapon right from the start.
- New modifier for coop Relic Hunt, which enables the second station's weapon right from the start.
- New modifier for Relic Hunt, which enhances the monsters damage.
- Added the option to unbind keybindings.
- Reworked the network synchronization for Drops, which should improve the network stability greatly and fix several issues around drops in multiplayer. 
- Improved performance for longer runs and larger maps. 

MINOR
- Updated some music tracks.
- Catgoblins will flee the dome when it gets destroyed.
- The Orchard Buff now also depletes while a wave is active in multiplayer. 
- Various text adjustments.
- Damage from Electrified Hull now is tracked in the run statistics.

BUGFIXES
- Fixed keeper selection to not be stored between game starts.
- Fixed Underground Station revealing always Team1 resources in multiplayer.
- Fixed resources mined by Assessors Exploding Spheres and Drillbert not tracked as mined resources in the run statistics, which was especially relevant for Prestige Miner Mode.
- Fixed catgoblins revealing tiles that should remain hidden.
- Fixed the interaction with the Sidedrillers when multiple players tried to interact with it at once. 
- Fixed drones flying on the worlds surface in Versus mode. 
- Fixed gadget and supplement dropping when using the One Way Teleporter with the Infiltrator.
- Fixed Orchard Canopy and Shields to properly sync in loaded multiplayer savegames. 
- Fixed the Beastmaster dropping resources in multiplayer unintentional. 
- Fixed several interaction cases between Lift and Infitrators Kunai Carrier. 
- Fixed Auto Repair in the 'Brutal Monsters' assignment. 
- Fixed the timer showing false values for the Client when loading a multiplayer savegame of some Assignments like 'Iron Contribution' and  'Logistical Nightmare'.
- Fixed Infiltrator's Rope Camera.
- Fixed the Resource Packer upgrades not scaling as intended.
- Fixed synchronization issues with Drillbert and other gadgets.
- Fixed issues with continue multiplayer savegame when a peer changed the keeper selection."
autowrap_mode = 3

