[node name="Label166" type="Label" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
text = "***NEW CONTENT***
MULTIPLAYER
- multiplayer is finally here! You can now play Dome Keeper with or against your friends, regardless the platform thanks to crossplay. 
- multiplayer is available for all game modes. The difficulty dynamically scales with player count.
- new game mode: Versus. Two teams compete against each other in a shared mine. Outperform the other team across two distinct win conditions.

GUILD REWARDS
- added two new guild rewards for everyone to unlock
- Automated Weapons: secondary weapons are now controlled automatically
- Additional Reroll Offers: increases the number of free rerolls available per run 

OTHER
- added individual keeper input settings. You can now configure controls separately for each keeper, allowing better adaptation to different playstyles 
- reworked free reroll system. Instead of one free reroll per gadget or supplement, each player now has a pool of free rerolls per run. The limit can be increased via guild rewards. 
- unfortunately we had to disable modding for now. We are working on it and will reintroduce it as soon as possible.
- added Euskara (Basque) language support, thanks to the valiant efforts of katukinabarra
"
autowrap_mode = 3

[node name="Label168" type="Label" parent="Canvas/PatchNotesPanel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
text = "*** THE LOST KEEPERS CONTENT ***
KEEPERS
- added new keeper: Infiltrator. A nimble keeper moving swiftly using a rope and agile jumps, while attacking with precise and powerful kunai. Offers high mobility and strong mining capabilities. 
- added new keeper: Beastmaster. An arcane keeper traversing the mines using tentacles, commanding catgoblin minions to assist with mining and resource handling. Introduces a more indirect and strategic playstyle.
- each keeper comes with its own complete OST

ASSIGNMENTS 
- added 9 new guild assignments with unique challenges and rules: 
- Minor Vision: The planet is engulfed in darkness, heavily limiting visibility. 
- Acid Rain: Constant acidic rain damages the dome over time. 
- Tree Farm: Very few natural resources, but resource tree seeds can be found and cultivated. 
- Survival of the Fittest: Only the largest and strongest monsters appear. 
- Brutal Monsters: Monster attacks deal significantly increased damage to the dome. 
- Hazardous Iron: Iron damages the dome when processed, requiring careful resource management. 
- Broken Comms: Enemy waves can no longer be tracked via the proximity meter. 
- Emergency: The guild requires timed resource contributions during the run. 
- Logistical Nightmare: Abundant water supply shifts the focus heavily onto logistics and transport. 

OTHER
- added 5 new unlockable pets to live in your dome
- added new skins to unlock for both existing and new keepers "
autowrap_mode = 3

