- improved lighting for better performance
- fixed the repellent ability duration indicator not disappearing after a battle ended
- fixed some upgrades not showing correctly in prestige mode
- improved visuals for buffed keepers
- fixed several entities, including Drillbert, not properly respecting pause
- fixed the vignette still showing after finishing a run
- fixed several crashes
- raised limits in cheat detection for prestige"
