- orchard shield now also blocks worm rocks
- buffed sword fast stab damage across all upgrades
- increased sword dome health by 25%
- changed how Javelin works. The sword now reappears immediately after shooting, and you are never blocked from moving the pad after shooting, but you can't control the Javelin anymore. To keep the timing, the charging does take slightly longer. To improve feedback on charging being finished, it charges not linear and ends with a sound and animation.
